  "scope": "Exact retained Go compiler/standard-library source input and original aggregate notice. All 12 distinct complete original notice blocks read, with canonical Apache2 full-text equality for pprof and the complete BoringSSL version-link difference read. Root and vendored BSD grants, MIT test fixture, Go patent scope and separately licensed optional crypto source remain independent. Parent OS and binary packages independently gated.",
