    "Retain every original copyright, all complete source/binary documentation notices and disclaimers, named nonendorsement restrictions and Go patent grant/termination scope.",
    "Preserve independent Apache2, MIT, ISC, Intel BSD3 and OpenSSL/SSLeay license scopes; retain both OpenSSL acknowledgements, Eric Young cryptographic credit and Tim Hudson credit with the corresponding source and any covered advertising. Do not rename products OpenSSL or imply endorsement.",
    "Supply exact source and build/install scripts. Optional BoringSSL source/object licensing does not assert that the distributed client was compiled with GOEXPERIMENT=boringcrypto; actual binary build settings independently establish compilation mode. No GPL relicense of OpenSSL/SSLeay source is asserted."
